# PLACEHOLDER: Droidtop Core's public key is not committed yet (Droidtop/tracker#550).
#
# The coordinator replaces this whole file with Droidtop Core's PUBLIC key
# (public material) as a PEM block, "-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----" ...
# "-----END PUBLIC KEY-----", e.g. the output of
#   openssl x509 -in droidtop-core.crt -noout -pubkey
# Never the certificate's private key, never anything from the UCM root above
# it. While this file holds no key, the build pins no Droidtop Core
# (DroidtopCore.key() is null): no certificate-format official bundle
# installs, and the component catalog is accepted unsigned. docs/SPEC.md 12a
# "Signatures: certificate chains to Droidtop Core".
